E0201 [Error] 433..435 expected a literal to close the range pattern
    note a range pattern is `lo..hi` or `lo..=hi` with a literal at both ends (integer or `char`); the open ranges `..hi` and `lo..` are slice spellings, not patterns ([gram.pat.range])
